        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hijagi jea eebata ASEETA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Suh digheanyeeka gil ea deaweedajeega gil jea eang'waanya aba badiida aba ng'eanyiida NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETA ghweanigeagwa, gooneegwa jea oombala, eawoojiga sean jea oopiidana badayda ng'eanyiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba huumwa anyarjeawa gilinyoo ea heeda batiisa aseecheeka nyaawa eemoojiga jea oombala, iheenga giijeega geawi ea iheenga heayeeniga ghana gumsheaka geediga hees nyawiiri seenga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeaysiina ng'eanyi heeda nyaawa bea wagiida, ak goohirjeawayi daranajeega nyaawa ak nea ghoaghwardi aba beasta aseecheeka nyaawa siguura Asherimu; nea ghoalajaadi sanaamajeega nyaawa, ak goohuti gheawunga nyaawa aba hoowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiidu goohindunu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agooga gajagasa jeeda jea ghwaloat NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA aba bugusta eemoojigeagwa sean heeda jea ghwayiin gheawungaaschi headaanyi bea giibinda, ak gajuna ghadoawana, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gajayaada hoowa haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi sighwarda ea lukghumajeagaagu, ea gilagi bea gilatamanamughuush ea haleanjeeda ghadooweeda bea geatingeagwa, ea haleanjeeda ghadooweeda bea heeleesiinda, ea haleanjeeda ghadooweeda mwas gurooruunatkeagwa, ea gilinyoo ea duweacheeda dugweagwa gil ea dea noogeagwa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak abeeda aba hoowa gajayeagiischeena aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA, ak gajahoosana, agooga ea fuga mida jeesinga gealgeagwa, aba gadiyoojiga sean noosinyi, goonyi ghawooda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiidu goosindi gawuurji haleanjeeda sean sisinyi askweareani aba hiji, gilinyoo ea siida dasina gidadoabiiw aba gitaakta gheanyangaaschi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba miyeehita heeda jea afuufana ea heeda jea ahearana gooneegwa NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea iyoakghaawi Yordani, ak goopiidi ng'eanyiida gooneegwa NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA gideaba gajahearana, nea gaygagooneegwa fuufta aba heeda fuga was weajoodigeagwa mida meadajeegeagwa sean, ak abeeda gajabeaha hoyyoo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda heeda jea ghaghwal NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA ak ghamiinda gheawungaaschi aba hoowa, hean abeeda gajayeani haleanjeeda sean earukuneegwa, haleanjeedeang'wa sighwarda ea lukghumajeegeagwa, ea gilagi bea gilba atamanamughuush ea haleanjeeda ghadooweeda bea geatingeagwa, ea gea heeleesiinda ghayi ooyeaksi habeawooda sea NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak agooga gajahoosana aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA, agooga ea orjoogeagwa ea haweegeagwa, ea soomjoogeagwa bea headiga ea gea haweega, ea siida eemeeda Lawi mida jeeda mujiinajeegeagwa, aba gideaba niny manda headaanyi ghana gichea gwahearan aba heedeang'wa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ula adiidu giidaydi haleanjeadaang'u sisabwa geadi sighwarda gilinyoo ea heeda dea gheanyangaagu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "geaghus heeda jea ghwaloat NG'UTAMIIDA aba jeeda dooshingeagwa, aba hoowa gajadayda haleanjeadaang'u sisabwa geadi sigwariida, nea aba hoowa gaysina gilinyoo darukuneey.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ama ng'ata, giimuusi jeeng'sheena ak giyaagi banyeega aba jeeda gealgeagwa, ghoah gidagasiida gurooroadaang'u, gawuurji ghawooda goonyi Ng'utamiida was ASEATAANG'U, fuga badeeda ea gea mandeawana badeeda ghoamu ghwaak, gawuurji gea mayeanda ea gea ndoopkeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiidu ghoayaaji foojeanda; oohisiina badayda ng'eanyiida gawuurji beega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiidu giyeaksi gheang'u gilagi bea jeeda gilatamanamughuush bea boagaagu, ea difaayeadaang'u ea nagheadaang'u ghana duweachajeega dugwaagu ghana noagaagu, ghana haleanjeeda ghadooweeda wassean bea heeleesiinda, ghayi iheeleesi, mwas gurooroadaang'u ea gea iyaadi geatingaagu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gajayeaksiina madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U aba heeda jea ghoahiimu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U ang'iing'i ea orjeedang'u ea hudaang'u, soomjeandaang'u bea headiga ea soomjeandaang'u bea haweega, ea siida eemeeda Lawi mida jeeda gealgaagu; ak abeeda gihoosani aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U aba haleanjeeda sean iisini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak sikteawana adiidu gwarooseey siida eemeeda Lawi eawoojiga sean iibiidi jeeda ng'eanyiidaang'u.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inyas ghoahaat NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U moonghooda ng'eanyiidaang'u gawuurji gida ghayi rukuneey, ak giyeeni ‘geagasayi daak banyeega,’ aba gideaba gibearjeewi dooghooda banyeega, giimuusi aga muuchi ea adeena gidigasiidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyas heeda loat NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U ghoah heeda jea ghwayiin gheawungaaschi iisheageewaneey, abeeda giimuusi nuus agi aba jeeda dugwaagu ghana jeeda noagaagu, goonyi NG'UTAMIIDA, gawuurji gidearukuneey; ak gajaga aba jeesingeaba gheang'u gidigasiidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawuurji gisiyeakiida mayeanda ghana ndoopkeeda, hean gajayaaktunu; nea eara fuga ririnnyeanda ea gea maba ririnnyaan eara saawa gayghwaak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiidu giyaagi foojeanda, aba gideaba foojeanda eaweega gil, adiyeaguudayi eaweega ea banyeega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiidu giyaagi; ahisiina ng'eanyi gawuurji beega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiidu giyaagi; ak gaynyasa doobiiwnata ang'iing'i ea diibigaagu jea gamaseawneey, iisini ng'asheega doobiiweadi aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama haleanjeadaang'u ghaydidi ea haleanjeadaang'u iradi bea ghadooweeda, aada heeda jea ghwaloat NG'UTAMIIDA, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak giidaydi haleanjeadaang'u bea ghadooweeda sighwarda, was banyeega ea foojeanda, heeda wagiida bea NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U; ak foojeanda lukghumajeagaagu gaygaweayeesa heeda wagiida bea NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U, nea banyeega gajaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sina badiida aba giing'ooydeaba ng'asheesu earukuneeyiin, ak gaynyasa doobiiwnata ang'iing'i ea diibigaagu gida manda muudeanooda,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
