              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nea aba damanda jea ghabwara NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U eemoojiga jea aweayeena jeeda ak goombali ak ghoareachi, ak ghoareachi saawa ak goopiidi ng'eanyiida nyaawa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "asi sina badiida adiidu geaghasnyi ak ghoayaachi geeshta nyaawa, nea goola eehuuyda aba madeadaang'u, nea adiidu gigasayi nala aseecheeka nyaawa, nea giyeeni, ‘Eemoojisu gabatiidaani aseecheeka nyaawa? Ak eara aniini gaydahindunu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiidu gihindunu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U; gilinyoo ghawas gida muy sit NG'UTAMIIDA ghwanung' ghoah aseecheeka nyaawa, inyeesa ghaghwarda orjooga nyaawa ea haweega nyaawa aba beasta aba badahuuka aseecheeka nyaawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
